# Cloudflare Pages redirects
#
# Short links for the social clip campaign (see ../social-captions.md).
# Short enough to say out loud in a voiceover, and each one tags the visit so
# analytics can tell which platform — and later which clip — sent the traffic.
# 302 on purpose: these are campaign links, not permanent URLs.

/yt   /?utm_source=youtube&utm_medium=shorts&utm_campaign=clips   302
/ig   /?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=reels&utm_campaign=clips  302
/tt   /?utm_source=tiktok&utm_medium=video&utm_campaign=clips     302
